00:29:54.112 --> 00:29:56.091
- No one can live without a routine.

00:29:56.091 --> 00:29:57.099
Just forget that.

00:29:57.099 --> 00:29:59.380
If you guys don't have a routine,

00:29:59.380 --> 00:30:01.738
I would recommend you get one going.

00:30:01.738 --> 00:30:05.079
Because you cannot be mentally
healthy without a routine.

00:30:05.079 --> 00:30:07.471
You need to pick a time to get up.

00:30:07.471 --> 00:30:09.623
Whatever time you want, but pick one.

00:30:09.623 --> 00:30:11.593
And stick to it, 'cuz otherwise

00:30:11.593 --> 00:30:14.800
you dis-regulate your circadian rhythms,

00:30:18.148 --> 00:30:19.958
and bloody well stick to it.

00:30:19.958 --> 00:30:23.628
You're going to be way
healthier, happier, and saner,

00:30:23.628 --> 00:30:24.644
if you do that.

00:30:24.644 --> 00:30:26.079
The other thing that you need.

00:30:26.079 --> 00:30:29.343
This is one of the things
the psychoanalysts got wrong,

00:30:29.343 --> 00:30:30.176
I think, is that

00:30:30.176 --> 00:30:32.598
they overestimated the degree to which

00:30:32.598 --> 00:30:34.510
sanity was a consequence of internal,

00:30:34.510 --> 00:30:37.843
of being properly structured internally.

00:30:38.971 --> 00:30:40.781
'Cuz from the psychoanalytic
point of view,

00:30:40.781 --> 00:30:43.285
you're sort of an ego, and
that ego is inside you.

00:30:43.285 --> 00:30:45.634
Of course it rests on an
unconscious structure,

00:30:45.634 --> 00:30:48.309
but the purpose of psychoanalysis is to

00:30:48.309 --> 00:30:50.426
sort out that unconscious structure

00:30:50.426 --> 00:30:51.652
and the ego on top of it,

00:30:51.652 --> 00:30:53.521
and to make you a fully functioning,

00:30:53.521 --> 00:30:55.600
and autonomous individual.

00:30:55.600 --> 00:30:56.761
But there's a problem with that,

00:30:56.761 --> 00:31:00.094
because the reason that you're sane as a

00:31:01.363 --> 00:31:03.871
fully functional and
autonomous human being

00:31:03.871 --> 00:31:06.686
isn't because you've
organized your psyche,

00:31:06.686 --> 00:31:08.386
even thought that's important.

00:31:08.386 --> 00:31:09.780
The reason that you're sane,

00:31:09.780 --> 00:31:13.727
if you have a well-organized
unconscious and ego,

00:31:13.727 --> 00:31:16.645
is because other people can
tolerate having you around

00:31:16.645 --> 00:31:18.987
for reasonably extensive periods of time,

00:31:18.987 --> 00:31:21.854
and will cuff you across
the head every time

00:31:21.854 --> 00:31:22.928
you do something so stupid

00:31:22.928 --> 00:31:26.625
that people will dislike you
permanently if you continue.

00:31:26.625 --> 00:31:29.345
So what people are doing
to each other all the time,

00:31:29.345 --> 00:31:30.512
just non stop,

00:31:31.372 --> 00:31:35.096
is broadcasting sanity
signals back and forth, right.

00:31:35.096 --> 00:31:38.058
It's like you smile at people if they're,

00:31:38.058 --> 00:31:39.965
well not only behaving properly,

00:31:39.965 --> 00:31:41.819
but behaving in a way that you would like

00:31:41.819 --> 00:31:43.741
to see them continue to behave.

00:31:43.741 --> 00:31:45.306
You frown at them if they're not.

00:31:45.306 --> 00:31:46.312
You ignore them if they're not.

00:31:46.312 --> 00:31:47.195
You shun them.

00:31:47.195 --> 00:31:48.904
You roll your eyes at them.

00:31:48.904 --> 00:31:50.444
You manifest a disgust face.

00:31:50.444 --> 00:31:52.339
You don't listen to
them, you interrupt them.

00:31:52.339 --> 00:31:53.712
You won't cooperate with them.

00:31:53.712 --> 00:31:54.897
You won't compete with them.

00:31:54.897 --> 00:31:57.495
It's like you're blasting
signals at other people

00:31:57.495 --> 00:32:01.092
about how to regulate their
behavior, so frequently,

00:32:01.092 --> 00:32:03.841
it just makes up all of
your social interaction.

00:32:03.841 --> 00:32:05.428
That's why we face each other.

00:32:05.428 --> 00:32:07.587
We have emotional displays on our face,

00:32:07.587 --> 00:32:09.249
and we're looking at each others eyes.

00:32:09.249 --> 00:32:10.703
And we know exactly,

00:32:10.703 --> 00:32:11.813
we know as much as we can

00:32:11.813 --> 00:32:13.804
about what's going on with each other,

00:32:13.804 --> 00:32:15.365
given that we don't have immediate access

00:32:15.365 --> 00:32:17.305
to the contents of their consciousness.

00:32:17.305 --> 00:32:20.074
Partly what you're doing with your routine

00:32:20.074 --> 00:32:23.504
is establishing yourself
as a credible, reliable,

00:32:23.504 --> 00:32:26.899
trustworthy, potentially
interesting human being,

00:32:26.899 --> 00:32:29.854
who isn't going to do anything
too erratic at any moment.

00:32:29.854 --> 00:32:31.439
And everyone else is around there

00:32:31.439 --> 00:32:32.963
tapping you into shape,

00:32:32.963 --> 00:32:35.382
making sure that that's
exactly what you are.

00:32:35.382 --> 00:32:36.826
And that's how you stay sane.

00:32:36.826 --> 00:32:39.496
What happens to people too,
if they don't have routine,

00:32:39.496 --> 00:32:42.602
and they get isolated,
is they start to drift.

00:32:42.602 --> 00:32:46.254
They drift badly, because
the world is too complicated

00:32:46.254 --> 00:32:49.341
for you to keep it
organized all by yourself.

00:32:49.341 --> 00:32:51.100
You just cannot do it.

00:32:51.100 --> 00:32:55.267
So a lot of our, so we
outsource the problem of sanity,

00:32:56.395 --> 00:32:58.716
and it's very intelligent
that we outsource

00:32:58.716 --> 00:33:00.084
the problem of sanity because

00:33:00.084 --> 00:33:03.589
sanity is an impossibly complex problem.

00:33:03.589 --> 00:33:05.697
And so the way that we manage

00:33:05.697 --> 00:33:06.823
the incredibly complex problem,

00:33:06.823 --> 00:33:10.391
is we have a very large
number of brains working

00:33:10.391 --> 00:33:13.601
simultaneously on the
problem all the time.

